BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Turkey Waddle Hike 2026
DTSTART:20261127T100000
DTEND:20261127T123000
UID:a4d4f2d0da5bcffd79a94c302a1c5ff5@jacklondonpark.com
DESCRIPTION:Skip the shopping crowds and spend the day after Thanksgiving 
 enjoying the great outdoors! Join us for a refreshing guided hike through 
 the park’s beautiful mixed evergreen forests to the majestic Ancient Red
 wood. Bring family and friends\, enjoy some fresh air\, and discover a lit
 tle post-holiday magic along the trail. This moderate\, approximately 3.5-
 mile round-trip hike leads to an old-growth coast redwood that stood here 
 long before Jack London arrived\, and continues to stand as a living link 
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/events/turkey-waddle-2026
X-SOURCE:Jack London State Historic Park
END:VEVENT
